# ============================================================
# Keep these
# ============================================================
# NotepadPro/wwwroot/ is the Vite build output consumed at
# runtime — keep it in source control so clones work without
# a separate 'npm run build' step.
!NotepadPro/wwwroot/

# Ignore local Copilot instruction file moved into .github
.github/copilot-instructions.md
